## Notes

Testing dummy file creation with special characters (`"`) fails locally on Windows because the OS rejects `[Errno 22] Invalid argument` in filenames, but we explicitly tested the injection payloads inside `escape_ps_string()` along with direct `Write-Output` to the powershell base64 encoded payload process, successfully verifying that powershell handles the string literally and avoids executing injected commands.
